{"@context":["https://litlfred.github.io/folio-assistant/ns/content/v1.jsonld",{"@base":"https://litlfred.github.io/folio/","folio-assistant-core":"https://litlfred.github.io/folio-assistant-core/v0/ns/"}],"@id":"papers/quantum-observable-universe/blocks/tbl-alpha-em-categorical-trace-ratio-table-data","@type":["folio-assistant-core:Table","doco:Table"],"label":"tbl:alpha-em-categorical-trace-ratio-table-data","kind":"table","title":"Numerical verification of $\\alpha_{EM} = h^{2} / [q \\cdot \\delta^{\\mathrm{top}}_q(T_{2,9}) \\cdot \\delta^{\\mathrm{top}}_q(T_{3,5})]$ at the proton and muon $q_0$ anchors","uses":["papers/quantum-observable-universe/blocks/prop-alpha-em-categorical-trace-ratio"],"tags":["alpha-em","categorical-trace-ratio","numerical-verification","torus-knot"],"text":"alpha-em-categorical-trace-ratio-table-data.md","provenance":"authored","html":"<a id=\"tbl:alpha-em-categorical-trace-ratio-table-data\"></a><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>Quantity</th>\n<th align=\"right\">Proton anchor <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">q_0</code> (primary)</th>\n<th align=\"right\">Muon anchor <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">q_0^{(\\mu)}</code> (comparison)</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td><code class=\"language-math math-inline\">q</code></td>\n<td align=\"right\"><code class=\"language-math math-inline\">1.1099785828</code></td>\n<td align=\"right\"><code class=\"language-math math-inline\">1.1099785956</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code class=\"language-math math-inline\">h = q - q^{-1}</code></td>\n<td align=\"right\"><code class=\"language-math math-inline\">0.20906030</code></td>\n<td align=\"right\"><code class=\"language-math math-inline\">0.20906032</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code class=\"language-math math-inline\">\\delta^{\\mathrm{top}}_q(T_{2,9}) = q^{9} - q^{-9}</code></td>\n<td align=\"right\"><code class=\"language-math math-inline\">2.16660008</code></td>\n<td align=\"right\"><code class=\"language-math math-inline\">2.16660039</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code class=\"language-math math-inline\">\\delta^{\\mathrm{top}}_q(T_{3,5}) = q^{10} - q^{-10}</code></td>\n<td align=\"right\"><code class=\"language-math math-inline\">2.48662073</code></td>\n<td align=\"right\"><code class=\"language-math math-inline\">2.48662110</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code class=\"language-math math-inline\">h^{2} / [q \\cdot \\delta^{\\mathrm{top}}_q(T_{2,9}) \\cdot \\delta^{\\mathrm{top}}_q(T_{3,5})]</code></td>\n<td align=\"right\"><code class=\"language-math math-inline\">7.30870156 \\times 10^{-3}</code></td>\n<td align=\"right\"><code class=\"language-math math-inline\">7.30870098 \\times 10^{-3}</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code class=\"language-math math-inline\">\\alpha_{EM} = 1/(q\\,[9]_q\\,[10]_q)</code></td>\n<td align=\"right\"><code class=\"language-math math-inline\">7.30870156 \\times 10^{-3}</code></td>\n<td align=\"right\"><code class=\"language-math math-inline\">7.30870098 \\times 10^{-3}</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Identity match at fixed <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">q</code></td>\n<td align=\"right\">exact</td>\n<td align=\"right\">exact</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<p><em>Note.</em> The primary proton-anchored column (<code class=\"language-math math-inline\">q_0 = 1.109978582751381\\ldots</code>) matches the base term <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">q\\,[9]_q\\,[10]_q = 136.823209</code> of <a href=\"#prop:em-coupling-projection\" data-at=\"predicted-spectra/em-completeness-gauge-coupling\">Electromagnetic coupling from the antisymmetric braiding and force-carrier crossings</a>; the muon-anchored column (<code class=\"language-math math-inline\">q_0^{(\\mu)} = 1.109978595642739\\ldots</code>) is retained for anchor comparison (<code class=\"language-math math-inline\">7.94 \\times 10^{-8}</code> relative shift between pins).</p>\n","source":"folio/quantum-observable-universe/predicted-spectra/alpha-em-categorical-trace-ratio-table-data.md","heading":"Table","page":"b/tbl-alpha-em-categorical-trace-ratio-table-data","qa":{"counts":{"pass":31,"fail":0,"warn":0,"na":27,"unknown":0,"stale":57}}}
